 3180: /// alive under editor virtualisation, so the caret and selection
 3181: /// highlight always paint and the geometry registry always knows their box.
 3182: ///
 3183: /// Also drives incremental rebuild: a block is only re-rendered when its
 3184: /// content changed ([blockChanged]) *or* when the selection / caret / IME
 3185: /// composition touches it. A pure caret move inside a different block leaves
 3186: /// this block's cached child intact, avoiding the inline-span rebuild that
 3187: /// would otherwise run for every block on every keystroke.
